{
  "audio": "Q02_dtjnt.lesson.mp3",
  "totalSec": 147.634,
  "teachEndSec": 96.003,
  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "intro",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "大体积温控,丢分在只背数字不讲因果",
        "tone": "q"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "大体积温控,很多人把温升五十、温差二十五背下来就上场,一换工程就懵。今天沿一条因果链走,把每个数字挂回它的物理原因。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 13.158
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "heat",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "S1 源头:水泥水化放热,大体积散不出去",
        "tone": "a"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "causal_chain.s1_hydration_heat.claim",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先看热从哪来。水泥遇水放热,叫水化热。大体积构件厚,热量积在芯部散不出去,芯部就憋高了。",
      "startSec": 13.558,
      "durSec": 10.37
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "gradient",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "S2 芯热表凉 → 里表温差≤25℃",
        "tone": "a"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "causal_chain.s2_core_surface_gradient.claim",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "芯部憋热、表面散得快,芯热表凉,里表温差就出来了。教材把里表温差不大于二十五度当成控制量。",
      "startSec": 24.329,
      "durSec": 10.219
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "stress",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "S3 内胀外缩,表面被拽住 → 温度应力",
        "tone": "a"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "causal_chain.s3_temperature_stress.claim",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "有温差就胀缩不均:芯部想胀、表面想缩,反向力把表面拽住受拉,这就是温度应力。",
      "startSec": 34.948,
      "durSec": 9.21
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "crack",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "S4 应力 > 早龄期抗拉强度 → 裂缝",
        "tone": "a"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "causal_chain.s4_crack.claim",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "早龄期混凝土抗拉强度很低,温度应力一旦超过当时的抗拉强度,裂缝就来了。它是前三步的必然结果。",
      "startSec": 44.559,
      "durSec": 10.012
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "valves",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "S5 四个数 = 一条链上的四个阀门",
        "tone": "concl"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "causal_chain.s5_four_valves.claim",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "所以控制只有一条路:关住每个阀门。温升≤五十、里表温差≤二十五、降温≤每天两度、拆保温温差≤二十——这四个数就是同一条链上的四个阀门。",
      "startSec": 54.971,
      "durSec": 13.679
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "valves",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "采分词:温升≤50 · 里表≤25 · 降温≤2.0 · 拆保温≤20 · 养护≥14d",
        "tone": "score"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "scoring_points[0].keywords",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "采分就盯这几组词:温升五十、里表温差二十五、降温每天两度、拆保温二十,再加保湿养护不少于十四天。",
      "startSec": 69.05,
      "durSec": 11.501
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "valves",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": {
        "text": "迁移:控温逻辑通用,限值随结构变",
        "tone": "concl"
      },
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "master:R2_invariant",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记住:换成筏板、大型设备基础,控的还是控温度梯度不是控绝对温度,实测比限值、超了就干预。换了结构,限值随结构给,这条判读链不变。",
      "startSec": 80.951,
      "durSec": 15.052
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师,我只写了'控制温升、加强养护',为啥还丢分?",
      "startSec": 96.403,
      "durSec": 5.406
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "common_errors[0].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "你把温升当唯一指标了。温控是三件套并列:温升≤五十、里表温差≤二十五、降温≤每天两度,缺一项就漏采分。",
      "startSec": 102.209,
      "durSec": 11.058
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那快点降温、早拆保温,不就省事?",
      "startSec": 113.668,
      "durSec": 3.735
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "common_errors[1].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "这正是坑。危险的是里表温差这个梯度,不是绝对温度高。保温是让表面慢冷、缩小梯度,降太快温差拉大照样裂。",
      "startSec": 117.803,
      "durSec": 11.516
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那保温层够14天就能拆吧?",
      "startSec": 129.719,
      "durSec": 2.632
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "anchor": "common_errors[2].why",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不能只看天数。拆保温前要查表面与大气的温差不大于二十度才能拆,否则表面急冷拉裂。养护十四天和拆保温温差二十度是两条,别混。",
      "startSec": 132.751,
      "durSec": 14.083
    }
  ]
}